Local HiDPI compatibility patch: custom-rendered canvases can provide dataset.danmakuWidth/Height in CSS pixels for correct collision allocation. The raster backing stays at native DPR. See danmaku-hidpi.patch. web/danmaku.js is this project's time/safety/density adapter.
